<!-- Group-level readout, in the free space beside the state machine (which spans
     x 20..820, y 73..394). The two lamps are not faults - they are what the LAST
     RESET FOUND in the grippers, which is what tells an operator why the reset took
     the route it took: straight home, back into slot 1, or on into slot 2. -->








